TI  - Future increases in Arctic lightning and fire risk for permafrost carbon
T2  - NATURE CLIMATE CHANGE
KW  - CLIMATE-CHANGE
KW  - BOREAL FIRES
KW  - EMISSIONS
KW  - TEMPERATURE
